  usecase__InitiateThirdPartyLogin ->> entity__Client: read
  usecase__InitiateThirdPartyLogin -) extsystem__RpCallbackEndpoint: The OP sends the browser to the client's initiate_login_uri
  usecase__InitiateThirdPartyLogin -->> screen__AppLauncherScreen: done
  Note over screen__RpSignInScreen: 2. Send the authentication request
  actor__RelyingParty ->> screen__RpSignInScreen: Send the authentication request
  screen__RpSignInScreen ->> api__AuthorizationApi: Authorization endpoint
  api__AuthorizationApi ->> entity__Client: read
  Note over api__AuthorizationApi: transaction (API atomic boundary)
  api__AuthorizationApi ->> entity__AuthorizationRequest: create nonce=set [An ID Token comes back from the authorization endpoint], nonce=null [No ID Token comes back from the authorization endpoint]
  api__AuthorizationApi ->> entity__Interaction: create
  api__AuthorizationApi -) api__RequestValidationApi: The authentication request arrived
  api__AuthorizationApi -) api__ErrorResponseApi: The authentication request arrived
  api__AuthorizationApi -->> screen__RpSignInScreen: done
  Note over api__RequestValidationApi: 3. Validate the request
  usecase__RequestAuthentication ->> api__RequestValidationApi: The authentication request arrived
  alt AuthorizationRequest.status == Received
    api__RequestValidationApi ->> entity__Client: read
    api__RequestValidationApi ->> entity__AuthorizationRequest: update status Received -> Validated [No code is issued (Implicit Flow)], status Received -> Validated [The client is confidential], status Received -> Validated [The request carries an S256 code challenge]
    api__RequestValidationApi -) api__SessionLookupApi: The authentication request is valid
    api__RequestValidationApi -) api__ErrorResponseApi: The authentication request is valid
    api__RequestValidationApi -) api__ErrorResponseApi: The authentication request is valid
    api__RequestValidationApi -) api__ErrorResponseApi: The authentication request is valid
    api__RequestValidationApi -->> usecase__RequestAuthentication: done
  else guard fails
    api__RequestValidationApi -->> usecase__RequestAuthentication: rejected
  end
  Note over api__ErrorResponseApi: 4. Reject an invalid request
  usecase__RequestAuthentication ->> api__ErrorResponseApi: The authentication request arrived
  alt A public client asks for a code without an S256 challenge: (AuthorizationRequest.pkce in (No PKCE, plain), AuthorizationRequest.response_type in (code (Authorization Code Flow), code id_token (Hybrid Flow), code token (Hybrid Flow), code id_token token (Hybrid Flow)), Client.client_type == Public client).along(AuthorizationRequest, Client) and AuthorizationRequest.status == Received
    Note over api__ErrorResponseApi: transaction (API atomic boundary)
    api__ErrorResponseApi ->> entity__AuthorizationRequest: update status Received -> Error response
    api__ErrorResponseApi ->> entity__Interaction: delete
    api__ErrorResponseApi -->> usecase__RequestAuthentication: done
  else guard fails
    api__ErrorResponseApi -->> usecase__RequestAuthentication: rejected
  end
