    api__LoginResumeApi -) api__ErrorResponseApi: The End-User is authenticated for the request
    api__LoginResumeApi -->> screen__LoginScreen: done
  else guard fails
    api__LoginResumeApi -->> screen__LoginScreen: rejected
  end
